# Slick Imitator (Start your engines!): Bot1 gets speed 1 with it on turn 1 and Lightning Bolts Bot2 each turn, so its speed is
# 2, 3 and 4 after the Bolts of turns 1, 3 and 5 (CR 702.179, 702.178a). On turn 3, below max speed, the Imitator's ability is
# not offered (the Bolt on the stack is a legal target; the Imitator just does not have the ability). On turn 5, at max speed,
# it pays {1} and sacrifices itself (CR 118.3) to copy a second Bolt aimed at Bot2; the copy is given a new target, Bot2's
# Llanowar Elves, and kills it, and the original still hits Bot2: 20 - 3 - 3 - 3 - 3 = 8 (CR 707.10c, 707.10).

